WEBVTT

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:09.940
When your customer searches for what you offer,
they're not looking for every business in Sarasota.

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:12.020
They're looking for businesses
they can actually find.

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:16.560
If that page isn't clear, easy to navigate,
and built to guide someone towards taking action,

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:19.040
more traffic is not going to solve the problem.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.600
Can customers find your business?

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:31.000
Find out where you stand and take
the online presence assessment with Wavefront.
